Privacy Policy for [Your History Web]
Last updated: [22.05.2026]
. Overview
This browser extension collects and stores browsing history data solely for the purpose of displaying it to the user within the extension interface. All data is processed and stored locally on the user’s device.

The extension does not transmit, share, upload, or send any data to external servers or third parties.

2. Data Collected
The extension collects only the following data:

Browsing History
Visited URLs

Page titles

Timestamps of visits

No other categories of data are collected.

3. How Data Is Used
Collected data is used exclusively to:

Display browsing history to the user

Provide the extension’s core functionality

The extension does not analyze, modify, or interact with the content of visited websites.

4. Data Storage
All collected data is stored locally in the user’s browser using IndexedDB.

No data is:

uploaded

transmitted

synchronized

shared with third parties

5. Data Sharing
The extension does not share any data with:

external servers

third parties

advertisers

analytics services

6. Permissions
The extension uses the following permissions strictly for functional purposes:

tabs — to read URLs of open tabs

webNavigation — to detect page loads

storage / IndexedDB — to store data locally

host permissions — to access visited URLs only

The extension does not modify website content.

7. User Control
Users may delete their locally stored browsing history at any time by clearing the extension’s data or resetting the browser’s storage.

